{
  "id": "347",
  "title": "What time is your flight?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-08-02",
  "synopsis": "Ben is taking an early flight to Guangzhou.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/485/824c1cb0639ae2f6ca87cf40d7154eb17191c7b0.mp3?1698352604",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "飞机几点起飞？\n\n本：明天我要坐飞机去广州玩儿。\n丽丽：飞机几点起飞？\n本：早上7点20分。\n丽丽：那么早？我送你去吧！\n本：太好了！谢谢你！\n丽丽：我们要早一点去办登机。\n本：好的。\n丽丽：那我们明天早上5点见吧！\n本：好的。明天见！",
    "traditional": "飛機幾點起飛？\n\n本：明天我要坐飛機去廣州玩兒。\n麗麗：飛機幾點起飛？\n本：早上7點20分。\n麗麗：那麼早？我送你去吧！\n本：太好了！謝謝你！\n麗麗：我們要早一點去辦登機。\n本：好的。\n麗麗：那我們明天早上5點見吧！\n本：好的。明天見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What time is your flight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：明天我要坐飞机去广州玩儿。",
      "traditional": "本：明天我要坐飛機去廣州玩兒。",
      "pinyin": "běn míng tiān wǒ yào zuò fēi jī qù guǎng zhōu wán'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Tomorrow I'm taking a plane to Guangzhou for fun."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：飞机几点起飞？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：飛機幾點起飛？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì fēi jī jǐ diǎn qǐ fēi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: What time does your flight leave?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：早上7点20分。",
      "traditional": "本：早上7點20分。",
      "pinyin": "běn zǎo shang 1 diǎn 2 fēn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: 7:20 in the morning."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那么早？我送你去吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那麼早？我送你去吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà me zǎo wǒ sòng nǐ qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: That early? I'll give you a lift!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：太好了！谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "本：太好了！謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "běn tài hǎo le xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Great! Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我们要早一点去办登机。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我們要早一點去辦登機。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ men yào zǎo yì diǎn qù bàn dēng jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: We should go a bit early to check in."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：好的。",
      "traditional": "本：好的。",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那我们明天早上5点见吧！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那我們明天早上5點見吧！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà wǒ men míng tiān zǎo shang 1 diǎn jiàn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Let's meet tomorrow morning at 5!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "本：好的。明天见！",
      "traditional": "本：好的。明天見！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de míng tiān jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, see you tomorrow!"
    }
  ],
